er play mode\nGame user manual for better understanding\nVR remote control for taking the correct direction\nThere are three different playing levels: Easy, Medium, and Hard\nHigh-quality graphics to experience the realistic scenario\nReset option to reset all your scores\n\n\n\nLet's see how many strikes you can score consecutively.  Relax your mind in your leisure time. \nDownload it now!", "short_description": "The Bowling Game app is a realistic platform to enjoy the bowling experience anytime. Feel the bowling adventure and get the thrill of achieving the perfect strike. \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.moonapps.xyz/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Moon Technolabs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.moonapps.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8606345966056277"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 11, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "674858308973337"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "2996007027277019"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "879005578442520"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2327273817695485"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1161848012596899"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1138857031206404"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2549601192081359"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1180948754070464"}, {"status"